tem of equations:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}2a+3b=-5 \\\\ -2a+3b=11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution is $($\n{{field-1}}$\\,,$\n{{field-2}}\n$).$"] [#edb/ref 17592186496289 "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{\\begin{aligned}4r+9v=3 \\\\ 8r-2v=1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe variable $r$ can be eliminated from the system using the following two steps:\n\n1\\. Multiply the first equation by $-2$ and obtain\n\n  $$\n  \\begin{aligned}-8r-18v & =-6.\\end{aligned}\n  $$\n\n2\\. Add the multiplied equation to the second equation to get\n\n  $$\n  \\begin{aligned}⋯\\,\\,?\\,\\,⋯\\,\\,=-5.\\end{aligned}\n  $$\n\nWhat's the missing expression?"] [#edb/ref 17592186496304 "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}4u+5p=24 \\\\ 5u+p=9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe variable $p$ can be eliminated from the system using the following two steps:\n\n1\\. Multiply the second equation by $-5$ and obtain\n\n  $$\n  \\begin{aligned}-25u-5p=-45.\\end{aligned}\n  $$\n\n2\\. Add the multiplied equation to the first equation to get\n\n  $$\n  \\begin{aligned}⋯\\,\\,?\\,\\,⋯\\,\\,=-21.\\end{aligned}\n  $$\n\nFind the missing expression, and hence find the solution $(u,p)$ of the system."] [#edb/ref 17592186496305 "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}-5x+7y=-20 \\\\ 4x-y=-7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe variable $y$ can be eliminated from the system using the following two steps:\n\n1\\. Multiply the second equation by $7$ and obtain\n\n  $$\n  \\begin{aligned}28x-7y=-49.\\end{aligned}\n  $$\n\n2\\. Add the multiplied equation to the first equation to get\n\n$\\,$\n{{field-1}}$=-69.$\n\n$\\,$\nHence, the solution to the system of equations is $($\n{{field-2}}$\\,,$\n{{field-3}}\n$).$"] [#edb/ref 17592186496314 "Consider the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}3p-6q=-18 \\\\ 4p+3q+2=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFind the solution $(p,q)$ to this system using the method of substitutio