 **I.** The system is consistent dependent\n- **II.** The system is consistent independent\n- **III.** The system is inconsistent"] [#edb/ref 17592186523112 "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y-2z=-4 \\\\ x+3y=-8 \\\\ x+y-4z=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The system is consistent independent\n- **II.** The system is consistent dependent\n- **III.** The system is inconsistent"] [#edb/ref 17592186523119 "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x-3y=-5 \\\\ -2x+6y=10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The system is consistent dependent\n- **II.** The system is consistent independent\n- **III.** The system is inconsistent"] [#edb/ref 17592186523120 "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y+2z=0 \\\\ -2x-y-7z=-2 \\\\ 2x+11z=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The system is consistent independent\n- **II.** The system is inconsistent\n- **III.** The system is consistent dependent"] [#edb/ref 17592186523134 "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y+z=5 \\\\ x+2y+2z=7 \\\\ x+3y+5z=8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The system is consistent dependent\n- **II.** The system is consistent independent\n- **III.** The system is inconsistent"] [#edb/ref 17592186523146 "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y-z=1 \\\\ 2x+5y=7 \\\\ -2x-3y+5z=6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The system is inconsistent\n- **II.** The system is consistent independent\n- **III.** The system is consistent dependent"] [#edb/ref 17592186523149 "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$